# Fixture for reactant_count_helper_test: the placeholder as the whole rate
# law (issue #59).  BNG2 names reactant_1 itself as the rule's rate function,
# and RM, finding no expression to evaluate, read the rule's static rate,
# zero, so the rule never fired.
# Under TotalRate the propensity is the count of A(s~0), so each flips at
# rate 1 and Aoff(t) is binomial(100, exp(-t)).
begin model
begin molecule types
  A(s~0~1)
end molecule types
begin species
  A(s~0) 100
end species
begin observables
  Molecules Aoff A(s~0)
end observables
begin functions
  reactant_1()
end functions
begin reaction rules
  A(s~0) -> A(s~1)  reactant_1() TotalRate
end reaction rules
end model
begin actions
  writeXML()
end actions
